This skill is adapted from the Cloudflare Security Audit Skill.

Upstream: https://github.com/cloudflare/security-audit-skill
Upstream license: MIT

The six-phase methodology (recon → hunt → validate → report → structured
output → independent verification), the attack-class taxonomy, the
exploitability-first principles, and report-schema.json are derived from the
upstream project. report-schema.json is reproduced substantially verbatim;
SKILL.md is an adaptation wired into council-forge's artifact-first workflow,
and validate-findings.cjs was reimplemented as scripts/validate_findings.py
(stdlib Python) to match this repo's CLI-first, dependency-light convention.

